@38   = ~Welcome to my store, can I help you with anything today?~
@39   = ~Yes what can you show me today.~
@40   = ~No, not right now.~
@41   = ~Here is what I have, enjoy.~
@42   = ~Welcome back, would you like to see what I have for sale?~
@43   = ~Yes, let me see what you have today.~
@44   = ~Not right now.~
@45   = ~Welcome to my fine shop of fenced goods. Can I help you with anything today?~
@46   = ~Yes what can you show me today?~
@47   = ~Nothing right now I guess.~
@48   = ~No I guess not, not right now any way.~
@49   = ~Here is what I have today, enjoy.~
@50   = ~Greetings to you traveler. Are you a worshiper of Eilistraee The Dark Maiden? Well it matters not, we help all, regardless of faith. How may I serve you?~
@51   = ~I was wondering what services you offer great priestess of Eilistraee.~
@52   = ~Nothing for the moment, maybe later.~
@53   = ~The Dark Maiden blesses you child.~


